9993346,"text":"ははっ、拙者が暗き運命を背負い、歩みを重くするような者だと思うか？","nextNodeIds":[700300209]},{"nodeId":700300209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2967869370,"text":"重佐副船長から頼み事があるって聞いたのに、ここでのんびりと景色を眺めながら詩を読んでるなんて思わなかったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[700300210]},{"nodeId":700300210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":271724874,"text":"稲妻の一件が終わり、今や拙者の心に他念はない。璃月を再び訪ねるには、この地の詩を学び、綺麗な音を聴かねばならぬ。","nextNodeIds":[700300211]},{"nodeId":700300211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1584752842,"text":"お主らの手を借りたいことも本来はなかったが、お主らがここに来るのが一歩遅れたため、今はある。","nextNodeIds":[700300212]},{"nodeId":700300212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3167473314,"text":"んん？意味が分からないぞ。「本来はなかったが…今はある…」って、なんだよ！","nextNodeIds":[700300213]},{"nodeId":700300213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2800299570,"text":"おまえ、山の中でなにか悪いものでも食ったのか？なに言ってるのか全然伝わってこないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[700300214]},{"nodeId":700300214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2697689402,"text":"しーっ…これを聞くでござる。","nextNodeIds":[700300215]},{"nodeId":700300215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2152159018,"text":"どう思う？","nextNodeIds":[700300216]},{"nodeId":700300216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3741241650,"text":"おっ！この音…まるで吟遊野郎が弾いてるみたいだな。","nextNodeIds":[700300217]},{"nodeId":700300217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2594067658,"text":"ふむ、吟遊野郎？いつか、その人物とも会ってみたいものでござる。旅人、お主はどう思った？","nextNodeIds":[700300218,700300219]},{"nodeId":700300218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3279036610,"text":"その琴は壊れてるみたいだ。","nextNodeIds":[700300220]},{"nodeId":700300220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1128001914,"text":"うむ、確かにその通り。だがそれよりも肝心なのは、この琴には不思議な力がある点でござる。","nextNodeIds":[700300221]},{"nodeId":700300221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2527461682,"text":"この名もない古き琴は拙者が山を越える際、失われたとある洞府で偶然見つけたもの。","nextNodeIds":[700300222]},{"nodeId":700300222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1361281050,"text":"古くはあるが状態は良く、この琴を見ていたら、つい胸が高鳴り、弾いてみたくなった。","nextNodeIds":[700300223]},{"nodeId":700300223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":189490810,"text":"拙者が琴をつま弾くと、まるで誰かが共に弾いているかのような感覚に陥ったでござる。あの感覚、実に懐かしいものでござった…","nextNodeIds":[700300224]},{"nodeId":700300224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2445921850,"text":"えーと、まさか本当に幻覚が見えるようなものを食べたんじゃないよな？","nextNodeIds":[700300225]},{"nodeId":700300225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":4041427378,"text":"それはないと思うでござる。一曲弾き終わり、拙者は我に返った。そして、その洞府をよく観察すると、何かが秘められているような気がした。","nextNodeIds":[700300226]},{"nodeId":700300226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1850149450,"text":"生い茂る雑草を見たところ、その洞府は主が離れてずいぶんと久しいようでござった。しかし、机と椅子は埃を被っておらず、ほのかな香りが漂っていた。","nextNodeIds":[700300227]},{"nodeId":700300227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1225084170,"text":"さらに風の中をざわめく雑音さえも静まりかえっておったでござる。このような神秘的なところは、おそらく璃月の伝説で語られる「仙境」でござろう。","nextNodeIds":[700300228]},{"nodeId":700300228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1315898154,"text":"おおおおっ！ということは、その琴は仙人が残した宝物なのか！？","nextNodeIds":[700300229]},{"nodeId":700300229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":3626552890,"text":"ははっ、どうでござろう。ただこのような奇妙な出来事は、友に話すべきだと思ったのでござる。","nextNodeIds":[700300230]},{"nodeId":700300230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2988873354,"text":"だが、璃月の友は姉君以外にお主しかいない。","nextNodeIds":[700300231]},{"nodeId":700300231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":3560827978,"text":"姉君はこのようなことに興味がないかもしれぬ、だからお主を誘ってみたでござるよ。","nextNodeIds":[700300232]},{"nodeId":700300232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1242027162,"text":"そして、重佐副船長にお主のことを気に留めるよう頼んだ。残念なことに、お主らが来る前にこの琴は壊れてしまったが。","nextNodeIds":[700300233]},{"nodeId":700300233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2830638906,"text":"はぁ、これは拙者の手落ちでござる。拙者は琴を持って四方を流浪し、ついそれを弾き過ぎてしまった。","nextNodeIds":[700300234]},{"nodeId":700300234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1122722642,"text":"えっ、仙人の宝物も壊れたりするのか？","nextNodeIds":[700300235]},{"nodeId":700300235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1759658202,"text":"あの雷神様でさえ、永遠を掴むことはできなかった…ましてや他の物であれば、なおのことでござろう。","nextNodeIds":[700300236]},{"nodeId":700300236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":371180050,"text":"うぅ…お、おまえはオイラたちの塵歌壺をしっかりと守っとけよ！","nextNodeIds":[700300237]},{"nodeId":700300237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1725837122,"text":"幸い、この程度の損傷であれば修復できるはず。今はまるで眠っているかのようなもので、琴の中の力が時と共に散っている状態でござる。","nextNodeIds":[700300238]},{"nodeId":700300238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":339023626,"text":"正しい材料さえ見つかれば、それを呼び覚ますことができるでござろう。","nextNodeIds":[700300239]},{"nodeId":700300239,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2513721090,"text":"拙者の耳が正しければ、その材料は…琉璃百合。","nextNodeIds":[700300240]},{"nodeId":700300240,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":325522538,"text":"どうして分かるの？","nextNodeIds":[700300241]},{"nodeId":700300241,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2281637338,"text":"拙者は前に言ったでござろう、風は万物のささやきを抱え、巡っていると。その中のいくつかを拙者は聞いたのでござる。","nextNodeIds":[700300242]},{"nodeId":700300242,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2772733754,"text":"それゆえ、この古き琴の過去を少しだけ知っておる。","nextNodeIds":[700300243]},{"nodeId":700300243,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1427910170,"text":"拙者はここで待っていよう、材料のことを頼めるでござろうか。","nextNodeIds":[700300244]},{"nodeId":700300244,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1838638778,"text":"お主は璃月港の大英雄、これしきのこと問題ないでござろう？","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":700300219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3955483594,"text":"その琴は高そうだ。","nextNodeIds":[700300220]},{"nodeId":700300207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3627119378,"text":"ぶらぶらしてたみたいだね。","nextNodeIds":[700300208]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7003002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1032"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7003006,"order":6,"stepDescription":"古き琴の修復に必要な琉璃百合を探す","stepDescTextMapHash":3120484908,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7003006,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_ITEM_GIVING","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT",