":"うむ、質の良い琉璃百合でござる、これなら十分でござろう。これらをすり潰し、出てきた液に琴を浸ければ蘇るはず。","nextNodeIds":[700300402]},{"nodeId":700300402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2670611698,"text":"うむ——この懐かしい感じ、目覚めたようでござるな。","nextNodeIds":[700300403]},{"nodeId":700300403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1428569218,"text":"さあ、試してみるとよい、あとはお主に託そう。","nextNodeIds":[700300404]},{"nodeId":700300404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2201421674,"text":"託そうってどういう意味？","nextNodeIds":[700300405]},{"nodeId":700300405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2138132450,"text":"ははっ、詩人も時には言葉を素直に伝えるのでござるよ。「お主に託そう」とは、文字通りこの琴をお主に贈るという意味でござるよ。","nextNodeIds":[700300406]},{"nodeId":700300406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2510076818,"text":"再び璃月を訪れたのは、この地を聞くため。岩神が守るこの古き大地で、止まぬささやきを聞くことができた、拙者はもう満足でござる。","nextNodeIds":[700300407]},{"nodeId":700300407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1757304426,"text":"もちろん、いつの日かこの琴が不要になったら、拙者はそれを取りに来よう。しかし…その日が来ないことを願っておる。","nextNodeIds":[700300408]},{"nodeId":700300408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":846029458,"text":"さあ、拙者は旅を続けるでござる。こんな時、璃月人であればなんと言うのでござろうか？ふむ…きっとこうでござるな。","nextNodeIds":[700300409]},{"nodeId":700300409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1032,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":528965170,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、「またいつの日か会おう」！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7003004,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133104660,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SC